sequenceDiagram
    participant TUI as OpenCode TUI
    participant Plugin as TypeScript plugin
    participant Worker as Python worker
    participant Model as Voice model
    participant Audio as Audio device

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    Note over TUI,Plugin: Default path, streamSpeech off
    TUI->>Plugin: session.execution.succeeded
    Plugin->>Plugin: Sync and validate the final assistant message
    Plugin->>Plugin: parseReply strips fenced code and splits units
    Plugin->>Worker: speak(id, units, config)
    Worker->>Worker: Enqueue, bounded at 32 requests
    Worker->>Model: Synthesize unit 1
    Model-->>Worker: Audio
    Worker->>Audio: Play while the next unit synthesizes
    Note over Worker,Model: One synthesis thread feeds a one-slot playback queue
    Worker-->>Plugin: done, cancelled, or error
    end

    opt streamSpeech on
    TUI->>Plugin: Text deltas during generation
    Plugin->>Plugin: StreamingParser exposes complete sentences only
    Plugin->>Worker: speak per sentence, at most 32 active
    Worker-->>Plugin: done, cancelled, or error per request
    end

    Note over Plugin,Worker: Cancellation is cooperative. Pending audio is dropped, the active stream is aborted, and an in-flight model call finishes before synthesis stops.
